      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Project Scope**\n\nOkay, I'm setting the scope of this Python script, and I've decided to proceed with Google Cloud's `generative-ai` library for the LLM integration. My next steps are to figure out the authentication and setup within the `summarize_text.py` file to get that LLM working.\n\n\n**Refining Code Implementation**\n\nI've decided to proceed with the `summarize_text.py` file to handle text summarization using the `gemini-pro` model from Google Cloud's `generative-ai` library. I'm focusing on the implementation details now. The plan is to import the library, initialize the `GenerativeModel` with `gemini-pro`, craft a summarization prompt, and call the `generate_content` method within a defined function. A placeholder for the input text will also be included.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789818642749,
          "start": 1789818638883
        },
